  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3>• About our brand and products:</h3><p><strong>Rise and Revolt</strong> is a bold lifestyle brand showcasing anti-authoritarian apparel with protest vibes. We create high-impact t-shirts designed for people who value individuality, resistance, and self-expression. Our designs are simple, powerful, and made to be worn loud.</p><hr><h3>• What makes us different:</h3><ul><li>Strong identity-driven brand (not generic POD)</li><li>Simple, bold designs that resonate emotionally and socially</li><li>Unique crossover of <strong>activism + protest</strong></li><li>Products designed to be <strong>noticed, shared, and talked about</strong></li><li>Built for a passionate, engaged audience — not mass-market blandness</li></ul><hr><h3>• How affiliates can earn:</h3><p>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale generated through their unique referral link. Our products are highly shareable and identity-driven, making them ideal for social media, communities, and content creators. The stronger your audience alignment, the higher your conversion potential.</p><hr><h3>• How to promote us:</h3><ul><li>Share designs on social media (TikTok, Instagram, X, Threads)</li><li>Create lifestyle content around protest, activism, or daily routines</li><li>Highlight bold messages and relatable themes from our products</li><li>Use humor, commentary, or current events to drive engagement</li><li>Feature products in “outfit” or “daily essentials” style posts</li></ul><hr><h3>• Other information:</h3><ul><li>Ideal for creators in activism, political commentary, lifestyle, and protest niches</li><li>New designs released regularly for fresh content opportunities</li><li>Simple, bold designs that perform well visually and in short-form content</li><li>Built to convert with strong messaging and clear identity appeal</li></ul></div></div>",
